    "blogtextliquid_ra7Awx": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Warmth is a fragrance amplifier. Heat lifts the molecules off your skin faster and pushes them further into the air around you, which means a scent that sat quietly in February can suddenly become loud in July.</p><p>British summer calls for notes that feel refreshing and crisp: citrus that doesn't turn sour, green tea that provides relief, and clean woods that anchor the scent through warm evenings. Here is how to build your British summer rotation.</p>"
      }
    },
    "blocks_ji7beH": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_zNd6WG": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_614820f",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cool Alpine vs Eternal Verde: The Summer Upgrades",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_size_mobile": 28,
            "heading_line_height": 1.1,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 30,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 25,
            "column_1_text": "<p>Some fragrances just feel like immediate relief. <strong>Cool Alpine</strong> (inspired by Silver Mountain Water by Creed) is one of them. Opening with crisp green tea, bergamot, and blackcurrant, it evokes glacial mountain streams and crisp air.</p><p>It feels like a cold drink on a scorching afternoon, cutting through humidity without ever feeling sharp or abrasive.</p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p>For anyone who finds standard summer citrus a touch predictable, <strong>Eternal Verde</strong> (inspired by Hacivat by Nishane) is the connoisseur's choice. Juicy pineapple smoke and bergamot meet dry cedar and oakmoss.</p><p>This is a niche fragrance in feel: the sort of thing that earns an appreciative raised eyebrow and a 'what are you wearing?' across a crowded beer garden.</p>",
            "body_size": 17,
            "body_size_mobile": 15,
            "body_line_height": 1.9,
            "body_color": "#2D2A26",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "column_gap": 55,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "padding_top": 60,
            "padding_bottom": 60,
            "padding_horizontal": 40,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
