    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_fb81b45",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "section_padding": 60,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "heading": "<p>Luminous Wonder & Fate: when the evening keeps going</p>",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_spacing": 25,
            "box_color": "#1C1917",
            "box_radius": 15,
            "box_padding": 45,
            "box_spacing": 35,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>British summer has a specific plot twist: the day is warm, but the evening stays warmer than anyone expected, and nobody wants to go home. You need a scent that carries from daytime drinks into late night.</p><p><strong>Luminous Wonder</strong> (inspired by J'Adore by Dior) delivers golden solar florals and white woods that glow in golden-hour light.</p><p>Meanwhile, <strong>Fate</strong> (inspired by Chance EDP by Chanel) brings pink pepper, jasmine, and patchouli warmth that comes alive as the breeze cools.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#F5EFE6",
            "box_text_size": 17,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.9,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "subheading": "<p>Summer application tips for unpredictable weather</p>",
            "subheading_size": 42,
            "subheading_color": "#1A1816",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>A few small things make a real difference in summer. Moisturise first, because warm skin still needs a lipid barrier to hold onto fragrance oils.</p><p>Spray your wrists, the back of your neck under your hair, and the collar of your linen shirt. Fabric holds volatile citrus notes long after skin heat has evaporated them.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 17,
            "bottom_text_color": "#2D2A26",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.9
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
